# points (i, b_i + j), 0 <= j <= N_i; expected CS levels kappa_i (strings "p/q") and signs eps_i of
# phi_i along the direction (0, 1).  Values of the dictionary derived from the (p,q)-web and
# verified against the vertex in every chamber at Kahler weight 6; entries:
# (name, [(b_i, N_i)], [kappa_1..kappa_r], [eps_1..eps_r]).
